@host = https://localhost:7001

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Register Prosumer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-prosumer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nic": "200012345678",
  "fullName": "Test Prosumer",
  "email": "prosumer@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "0771234567",
  "password": "{{$processEnv SMARTSOLAR_SAMPLE_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Login - replace NIC/password with seeded Backoffice account or activated user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nic": "200012345678",
  "password": "{{$processEnv SMARTSOLAR_SAMPLE_PASSWORD}}"
}
